### Requests for the expenses endpoints (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client).
### Run the app with SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local. Log in with http/auth.http and paste each user's
### access token below. Roles come from team membership: create the team and invite people with http/teams.http.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@team = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@memberToken = paste-access-token-of-a-member
@approverToken = paste-access-token-of-an-approver
@ownerToken = paste-access-token-of-an-owner

### Create a draft (member)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "money": { "amount": "12.50", "currency": "EUR" },
  "category": "MEALS",
  "incurredOn": "2026-11-05",
  "merchant": "Cafe Central",
  "note": "Team lunch"
}

###
@expense = {{create.response.body.id}}
@etag = {{create.response.headers.ETag}}

### Read
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Edit (needs If-Match)
PATCH {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "merchant": "Bakery" }

### Submit
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}:submit
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Approve (approver)
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}:approve
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}

### Reject (instead of approve)
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}:reject
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Receipt is unreadable" }

### Reimburse (owner)
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses/{{expense}}:reimburse
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### List: filtered, sorted, paged (size max 100)
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/expenses?status=SUBMITTED&currency=EUR&sort=amount,asc&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
